I go into the living room.
The room is large and bright.
A wooden table stands against the wall.
That is my desk now.
I open my backpack.
The laptop stands on the table.
I also have three reference books for work.
The books lie next to the laptop.
My notebook lies in front of the laptop.
A pen lies on the notebook.
My bag stands under the table.
A small lamp stands next to the bag.
Everything has a place now.
The workspace is finally ready.
It is a real home office now.
I like my new flat.
